'''Commander Ostromeda''' (アンドロメ・ダ長官, ''Andorome Da-chōkan'', '''Secretary Androme Da''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[R.Ost]] introduced in the [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year|12th and 1/2 Anniversary]] stages. They were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

